[41.748, "o", "\r\n"]
[41.748, "o", "== 6b. a linked account, and what the agent's token gets then\r\n"]
[42.838, "o", "  ok    control: the owner linked the stand-in provider through Coder's OAuth flow (callback HTTP 307)\r\n"]
[43.548, "o", "  ok    once the owner has linked an account, the agent's token gets the owner's access token from inside the workspace: the very token the provider issued (sha256 7e4d5d1a0fbe)\r\n"]
[43.549, "o", "\r\n"]
[43.549, "o", "== 7. the same targets, from outside the boundary\r\n"]
[45.549, "o", "  ok    outside the boundary, https://example.com/ answers: HTTP 200\r\n"]
[45.551, "o", "  ok    outside the boundary, http://1.1.1.1/ answers: HTTP 301\r\n"]
